[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1382.549, "timestamp": "00:23:02", "text": "しばらく配信していませんね。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1387.669, "timestamp": "00:23:07", "text": "右？でも、あなたの配信が恋しいです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1390.47, "timestamp": "00:23:10", "text": "私を泣かせないで。ちょうどあなたの"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1398.23, "timestamp": "00:23:18", "text": "ええ、もう2ヶ月経ちました。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1402.789, "timestamp": "00:23:22", "text": "私の大切な人たち、ええ、私は皆さんのことが大好きです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1405.07, "timestamp": "00:23:25", "text": "ええ、そうですね。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1408.149, "timestamp": "00:23:28", "text": "うん。それから、私はコラボレーションもしていました"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1412.149, "timestamp": "00:23:32", "text": "ええと、アレクサーは今日の早い時間に、ええと、彼はこう言っています"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1416.27, "timestamp": "00:23:36", "text": "こんにちは。ああ、わかりました。わかった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1420.23, "timestamp": "00:23:40", "text": "こんにちは。何てことだ。アレクサーは素晴らしい。私"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1422.99, "timestamp": "00:23:42", "text": "アリスは私が"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1424.029, "timestamp": "00:23:44", "author": "@BreaDGuy0078", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/O8v1G-sabQKoVvPbSD8h_pLVydQ_mLyNSXpDD2A2gNJXBLHO228IzT5zq41iTuqUdmG_2xiIlg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "I also say hi"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1427.029, "timestamp": "00:23:47", "text": "ほぼ初日から知られていた。ええ、彼は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1428.789, "timestamp": "00:23:48", "text": "初日からずっとそこにいる。彼は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1432.23, "timestamp": "00:23:52", "text": "まるでついさっきまでそこにいたかのように。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1434.71, "timestamp": "00:23:54", "text": "そう、私も素晴らしいんです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1436.39, "timestamp": "00:23:56", "text": "みんな素晴らしい。私はまるで"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1439.11, "timestamp": "00:23:59", "text": "素晴らしい人たちと出会えた。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1439.716, "timestamp": "00:23:59", "author": "@BreaDGuy0078", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/O8v1G-sabQKoVvPbSD8h_pL